56:### `theme` takes five values — no `"default"` or `"auto"`
63:### Branding means a full token set, on both themes — never 2–4 tokens
105:### A section `ThemeProvider` with no provider above it themes the whole page
134:### Controls on a brand/colored background: fixed contrast, both themes
164:### Customization ladder — descend only when there's no higher handle
187:## Color & shape
189:### Use semantic tokens, never raw hex or private tokens
212:### Border radius uses a token, never a hard-coded `px`
224:## Component-prop traps (cross-cutting)
226:### `Button` uses `view`, not `variant` / `color`
235:### `Icon` takes an object via `data`, never a string name
248:## When in doubt

